## Artifact flow

```text
product brief
  -> feature contract
  -> architecture decision
  -> UX specification
  -> implementation plan
  -> code and tests
  -> release evidence
```

## Rules

1. Do not start implementation while critical product decisions are unresolved.
2. Do not silently change an approved requirement to make implementation easier.
3. Research architecture from current primary sources and compare realistic alternatives.
4. UI is not complete without loading, empty, error, permission, accessibility, and responsive/native states.
5. A feature is not done because an agent says so; it needs objective evidence.
6. Merge and production deployment require explicit owner approval.

Local execution logs belong in `.auto-company/runs/` and are intentionally ignored by git.
